    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733790/extras/ea8b20fa0d9590a247e62bdb78556087.avif?t=1734311251\" width=600 height=218 /></span><br>Esther and Ellie are twin sisters who used to get along great when they were younger. However, in the present, certain unfortunate incidents have driven a wedge between the two. As their emotions bubble to the point of bursting on Christmas Eve, Ellie is visited by three ghosts who offer mysterious gifts and visions of what was and what could be...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733790/extras/28a904d4f62be5dd85b06802ba872b1e.avif?t=1734311251\" width=600 height=225 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733790/extras/bfbd9602948c0a9382772c8c1563cea5.avif?t=1734311251\" width=264 height=280 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733790/extras/96a787a0d77f7e4a8730bae9122f2a1b.avif?t=1734311251\" width=288 height=287 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733790/extras/a4c7381799eae6c031804f4d7d157f60.avif?t=1734311251\" width=172 height=174 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733790/extras/44e26ec766d1112dbc8e8302396aa39a.avif?t=1734311251\" width=172 height=174 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733790/extras/dd84e633ca1bc3ff74a64fefed8eaa4a.avif?t=1734311251\" width=172 height=174 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733790/extras/61045cf3295c072a7f5370da32f7f167.avif?t=1734311251\" width=600 height=225 /></span><br><br>- Short tale of about 15k words;<br><br>- A hertwarming and fun christmas story;<br><br>- Choices that allow developing the state of reconciliation of the sisters;<br><br>- Dramatic and tense moments;<br><br>- Minigame of hiding objects on background!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733790/extras/17410ba1bd0255f05bd9b5104674c912.avif?t=1734311251\" width=600 height=225 /></span><br>Screenplay, artwork and development: B.G.Riccetto and M.Graymoon<br><br>General  support: M.Graymoon<br><br>Backgrounds: Original VN Maker and DLCs<br><br>Sounds and Musics: Original VN Maker, Cynicmusic, Rony D.Kid and OwlishMedia.<br><br>Special thanks to M.Graymoon. That keeps stopping me from giving up and pretending to be a vegetable &lt;3",
