=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733790/extras/61045cf3295c072a7f5370da32f7f167.avif?t=1734311251\" width=600 height=225 /></span><br><br>- Short tale of about 15k words;<br><br>- A hertwarming and fun christmas story;<br><br>- Choices that allow developing the state of reconciliation of the sisters;<br><br>- Dramatic and tense moments;<br><br>- Minigame of hiding objects on background!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733790/extras/17410ba1bd0255f05bd9b5104674c912.avif?t=1734311251\" width=600 height=225 /></span><br>Screenplay, artwork and development: B.G.Riccetto and M.Graymoon<br><br>General  support: M.Graymoon<br><br>Backgrounds: Original VN Maker and DLCs<br><br>Sounds and Musics: Original VN Maker, Cynicmusic, Rony D.Kid and OwlishMedia.<br><br>Special thanks to M.Graymoon. That keeps stopping me from giving up and pretending to be a vegetable &lt;3",
